### Key Commands

**Roadmap Management:**
```bash
# View roadmap status
python3 .claude/scripts/roadmap status

# Show sprint details
python3 .claude/scripts/roadmap show <sprint-id>

# List tasks
python3 .claude/scripts/roadmap list tasks

# Complete a task
python3 .claude/scripts/roadmap complete <task-id>
```

**Framework Management:**
```bash
# Use the /vibey command for:
# - Sprint planning (/vibey plan)
# - Sprint execution (/vibey code)
# - Framework management (/vibey manage)
```

